# Design & frontend

## Tokens

- Define colours/type in `public/assets/css/tokens.css` (light + `[data-theme="dark"]`)
- Brand teal `#115e59` · dark brand `#2dd4a0` · accent orange `#c2410c` · route/link `#0369a1`
- System font stacks only

## Map tool pages

- Slim top bar only (~48–56px); map fills the rest
- Graph dock under the map (not overlay); drag handle ≥24px; min 120px · default 180px · max 45vh / 40vh mobile
- Persist dock/graph/units/chips/view/overlays in `localStorage` key **`gpstoolset.ui.v1`**
- Floating chips for Open / Stats / graphs / Export / **Map|Video** — never cover the fitted track by default
- File drop: whole-map overlay; empty state centered card; privacy chip in empty state only (not header after load)
- Pre-upload SEO content sits **below** the drop zone and **hides after load**

## Video view (`/gopro-gps-extract`)

- Full-screen `<video>` via object URL; mini Leaflet map + metric overlays (toggleable)
- Sync with GPMF timestamps relative to video start; waiting-for-GPS-fix before first valid sample
- Fullscreen API; mobile-friendly

## Borders & chrome

- Thin neutral borders OK
- **Forbidden:** heavy coloured one-sided borders / accent stripes (e.g. thick coloured `border-left`)
- Drag-over / active drop = background tint (normal border OK)
- Privacy/About: **footer only**. No “Report a map issue”. No © OSM in footer (map Leaflet attribution only).

## Ads

- Render only via the central ads partial; respect `enabled=false`
- Map/viewer pages: `isMapPage=true` → **zero ads**

## JS style

- Vanilla modules or plain scripts; no React/Vue
- Leaflet only via vendored 1.9.4 + central `tiles.js`
- Prefer Chart.js (MIT) or canvas for graphs — not Highcharts
